# NG-PUDDLES (WTH-PUDDLES, Lagarde 2013 "Water drop 3a"): the world's rain on every lit surface and the landscape,
# one text (Common/WeatherRain.glslh): the film soaked into the pores (Wetness), standing water in the ground's dips
# read from the view's rain occlusion heightfield (PuddleLevel, PuddleShape), the ripple map on standing water and wet
# level faces and streaks down wet walls while it rains (RainIntensity, RainRipple*, RainStreak*). Every value is a
# row of WP_Weather; nothing is set here but the world's values.
Дано run Scene "Open Scene FIELD_Barn.desce"
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано run Entity "Sun"
Дано --subject selection set SunElevation 25
Дано --subject selection set SunAzimuth 110
Дано set world SceneSettings.WorldParameters assets:WorldParameters/WP_Weather.dworldparams
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,170,2500
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0.15,-0.25,-1
Тогда-вид 1_dry dry field and barn, identical to FIELD_Barn without WP_Weather (every rain value 0); editor.log has no shader compile error
Когда lua "WorldParameters.setScalar('Wetness', 1)"
Тогда-вид 2_wet the same view: ground and barn walls darker and glossier (porosity), no standing water anywhere, the ground under the barn roof dry
Когда lua "WorldParameters.setScalar('PuddleLevel', 1)"
Тогда-вид 3_puddles mirror-like puddles only in the ground's low spots (ruts, dips), sky reflected in them, none on slopes, none under the roof, none on the roof
Когда lua "WorldParameters.setScalar('RainIntensity', 1)"
Когда 30 frames render
Тогда-вид 4_puddles_rain the puddles now rippled (moving between frames 4 and 5), wet level ground carries faint ripples, the barn's sunlit walls show vertical streaks; still nothing under the roof
Когда 30 frames render
Тогда-вид 5_puddles_rain_later same as 4 with the ripples and streaks moved (pixel-diff 4 vs 5 only in water and on walls)
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position -300,2221,-3600
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction -0.53,-0.51,-0.7
Тогда-вид 6_overview from above: puddles in the field's low ground and along the track, roof dry of puddles, no tile pattern visible in the water
Когда lua "WorldParameters.setScalar('PuddleLevel', 0)"
Тогда-вид 7_drained the puddles gone the next frame, the ground still wet and rippling
